# Pydantic AI Documentation

Official documentation:
https://pydantic.dev/docs/ai/llms-full.txt

Local documentation:
@docs/pydantic-ai-llms-full.txt

## Instructions
- When working with Pydantic AI, consult the
  relevant sections of the local documentation.
- Search for relevant APIs and examples instead
  of loading the entire documentation.
- Prefer local documentation; check the official
  website when current information is needed.
- Verify compatibility with the installed
  pydantic-ai version.
- Never invent APIs, imports or parameters.
- Avoid deprecated APIs when alternatives exist.
- Follow documented patterns for agents, tools,
  dependencies, structured outputs and models.
- Never hardcode API keys or credentials.
- Explain missing or outdated documentation.
- Summarize implementation decisions in German.
  